{
  "description": "PR 风险定档：任一路径（含重命名前的旧路径）命中 high 即为高；其余路径全部命中 low 才为低，全部命中 low 或 medium 且有 medium 才为中；其余为 default（高）。low 和 medium 都是白名单，漏列的路径落到高风险，由所有者批准。匹配不区分大小写。改这个文件属于高风险。规则见 docs/agent/loop.md。",
  "default": "high",
  "high": [
    ".github/**",
    "scripts/**",
    "tools/**",
    "**/AGENTS.md",
    "**/AGENTS.override.md",
    "**/CLAUDE.md",
    "**/CLAUDE.local.md",
    "**/.claude/**",
    ".codex/**",
    ".mcp.json",
    "docs/agent/**",
    "docs/plan.md",
    "ARCHITECTURE.md",
    "cmd/**",
    "internal/**",
    "**/go.mod",
    "**/go.sum",
    "go.work",
    "go.work.sum",
    "Makefile",
    ".golangci.yml",
    ".gitattributes"
  ],
  "medium": [],
  "low": [
    "docs/**",
    "README.md",
    "**/*_test.go",
    "**/testdata/**"
  ]
}
